<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Teljoy H1 shr pre-exceps loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Teljoy H1 shr pre-exceps loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - pre-exceps	    15.7	  vs 3.2</p>
<p>    - post exceps	   10.1	  vs 3.2</p>
<p>    Attrib loss	     8.47	  vs 2.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss	    8.11	  vs 0.27</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.64	  vs 0.92</p>
<p>    Net financing charge  4.23	  vs 5.22</p>
<p>    Turnover		  302.53	vs 286.39</p>
<p>    Exceptional profit    13.83	 vs 45.05</p>
<p>    Exceptional losses    6.86	  vs 43.05</p>
<p>Full name: Teljoy Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said the exceptional profit arose from the disposal of shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
